5,1,1,talk,Minato,,I want to make sure the person in charge doesn't get too tired. I'll look into the outgoing treasurer's logged hours and the rota against the attendance record.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I want to avoid guesswork when setting the fees. I'll look into the bank statements on last year's renewals and the last year's ledger of outgoings.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minako,,I want to understand how our membership dynamics are changing. I'll look into the sign-up records for mid-year joiners and the taster evening forms from non-joiners.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,I want to see if people are actually enjoying themselves! I'll check the weekday turnout since the summer outings and the quieter members at the winter social.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I'll see if the workload is as skewed as the rumors suggest. I'll check the tally of the sign-in sheets and the rota against the attendance record.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
